{"id":"130ab752f509ade2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-subdirectly-irreducible.md","title":"Subdirectly Irreducible Algebra","display":"df-subdirectly-irreducible — Subdirectly Irreducible Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","aliases":["93-df-subdirectly-irreducible"],"display":"df-subdirectly-irreducible — Subdirectly Irreducible Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-subdirect-product]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subdirectly-irreducible — Subdirectly Irreducible Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate sourced through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\)</span> is the explicit product projection of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subdirectly\\text{-}irreducible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\neq b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall e\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\to\\exists i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e,\n\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subdirectly\\text{-}irreducible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\neq b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall e\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\to\\exists i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e,\n\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nontriviality is explicit, and the quantified similarity type is recovered from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>. Every subdirect representation has an isomorphic coordinate factor; the monolith condition is a theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirect-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is an algebra candidate and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate sourced through [[93-df-subdirect-product]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}$ is the explicit product projection of [[93-df-product]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subdirectly\\text{-}irreducible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\neq b)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall e\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\to\\exists i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e,\n\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"3296916b733e08cd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"72b151eab674506d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)$, $K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}$, and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"8335a662839d3ab3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, $\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}$ is its diagonal congruence, and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is defined in [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"c5534a58db9ff355","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is the subdirect-irreducibility predicate of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"3bbb7b7bf7df9f89","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ are the sourced predicates of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]] and [[93-df-subdirect-product]]."},{"id":"0d50db03d116b595","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is the subdirect-irreducibility predicate of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"b4923b63c348b8a7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)$ and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"730edd22d82070e5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]] and [[93-df-subdirect-product]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]"}],"outgoing":["aa0a957ca4da4328","260c377f5e1dcfdf","fe06c83d404633c2"]}